# Security

- Reference `Rkyves_Security_Compliance_Master_Requirements.md` and `docs/security-compliance/`.
- Preserve Turnstile/login backoff, JWT secret handling, and PII redaction utilities.
- Payment webhooks must verify signatures; never log full card/PII payloads.
- Flag IDOR/BOLA risks when adding endpoints that accept ids without org checks.
